# Ambitious Augmenter: "put this creature's counters on that token" means every counter, of every kind, in full (CR 608.2h). Bot1's
# Augmenter gets a +1/+1 counter from increment (the two-mana Cryogen Relic is more than its power 1), then attacks, and the
# tapped Augmenter takes a stun counter from the Relic. Lightning Bolt kills it with both kinds on it: the Fractal gets a +1/+1
# counter and a stun counter, not just one of them.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ambitious Augmenter
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Cryogen Relic
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ambitious Augmenter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cryogen Relic.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ambitious Augmenter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ambitious Augmenter > Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Cryogen Relic.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ambitious Augmenter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Ambitious Augmenter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Fractal Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Fractal Token.Counters.Stun = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Ambitious Augmenter; Lightning Bolt; Cryogen Relic
